    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to</strong> <strong>Pack Lunch!</strong> The game where you <strong>pack</strong> <strong>lunch</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're a very organised person, <i>aren't you?</i>\u00a0You prepared it the night before. So all\u00a0you had to do  was remember to take it out of the fridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You left the house in plenty of time and triple-checked the front door was locked behind you.\u00a0On the bottom step you felt for your keys, wallet, phone, and the rounded corner of your plastic lunchbox through  your bag lining. It was all there. You breathed a sigh of accomplishment, confident that you were in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because existence is chaos. Your lunchbox has come open and all  the food has fallen out. You're certain   the lid was closed properly when you picked it up but it isn't the first time this has happened (or the last) and you don't know what to believe anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You empty your bag  and start haphazardly refilling your lunchbox, only to find that it doesn't all fit anymore. What is that yo-yo doing in there? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So here we are.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just do your best and fit as much food in as you can without any overlapping.  With  some  trial and error, and a little luck, you should be able to get almost everything back in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And\u00a0<strong>don't give up.</strong>\u00a0The solution is never more than a few 90\u00b0 rotations away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403630/extras/ac475d37c5161d53ccf95e865ca27149.poster.avif?t=1752503749\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403630/extras/ac475d37c5161d53ccf95e865ca27149.webm?t=1752503749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403630/extras/ac475d37c5161d53ccf95e865ca27149.mp4?t=1752503749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eye-catching (and mouth-watering!) pixel-art designs:    <br>Over 50 unique food shapes in 40 unique (often abstract) designs; more than a dozen non-food shapes; a variety of colourful lunch boxes and baskets; and over 20 vibrant (and occasionally entrancing) level backgrounds. A real treat for the eyes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of content to sink your teeth into (and still leave you hungry for more?):   <br>Over 90 levels spread across 6 stages AND 2 Bonus Stages (with more coming!). All this plus a random level selector for when you can't decide what to have for lunch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-peasy controls:     <br>Play with mouse and keyboard or mouse only.  Drag, rotate, and drop.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe check:  <br>Choose between two original compositions: a cheerful sunny theme or a sombre rainy theme (or neither, it's up to you); to match your mood, or artfully compliment the weather outside.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No skips:<br>Old-school progression. Complete a level to unlock the next one. <strong>You can do it!</strong></p></li></ul>",
